体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="155"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1kHz @ 23℃ 200V/um</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="234"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Dielectric dissipation factor(tan delta)</span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="79"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="99"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">≤0.005</span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="155"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">200V/um</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="234"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="79"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="99"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="155"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2" rowspan="3" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="234"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Film Uniformity in thickness</span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" valign="top" width="79"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3.0-3.9</span>