span style=''font-family:"font-size:12pt;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">：</span><span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">201</span></span></span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">8</span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">.2</span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">.28</span></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <p><br/></p><div style="color:#000000;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:19px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;line-height:22px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1. </span></span> </div> <div style="color:#000000;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:19px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:22px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;">1.) </span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:1.5;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;">Type: BOPET 12µ / corona and chemical treatment</span></span> </div> <div style="color:#000000;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:19px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.) </span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:1.5;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;">Type: BOPET 36µ / corona and chemical treatment</span></span> </div> <div style="color:#000000;font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:19px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <p class="MsoBodyText"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3.) Type: BOPET 23µ / corona and chemical treatment</span></span></p> <p class="MsoBodyText"> <span><span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">and </span><span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;">chemical treatment (coated with COPOLYESTER,ACRYLIC</span><span style="background-color:window;"><span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> or </span><span><span style="color:#E53333;line-height:1.5;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;">coated with</span><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;background-color:window;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong> polyurethane </strong>) and see technology data details</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p class="MsoBodyText"> <span><span><span><span style="background-color:window;"><span><span><span style="background-color:window;"><span><br/> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p class="MsoBodyText"> <span><span><span><span style="background-color:window;"><span><span><span style="background-color:window;"><span><br/> </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> <p class="MsoBodyText"> <span><span><br/> </span></span></p> </div>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (34, 102, '4.5Microns BOPET thermal transfer film', '../upload/image/20180923/20180923113934_84965.jpg', '<p><br/></p><p class="MsoNormal"> <b><span style="color:#009900;">4.5μm High-Performance BOPET TTR Base Film</span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal"> <b><br/> </b></p> <p class="MsoNormal"> <b><span style="color:#009900;">I. Product Overview</span></b></p> <p class="MsoNormal"> <span style="color:#009900;">Our </span><b><span style="color:#009900;">Ultra-Thin BOPET Series</span></b><span style="color:#009900;"> serves as the premium foundational carrier for high-quality </span><b><span style="color:#009900;">Thermal Transfer Ribbons (TTR)</span></b><span style="color:#009900;"> and </span><b><span style="color:#009900;">Hot Stamping Foils</span></b><span style="color:#009900;">. It is engineered to act as a high-heat resistant skeleton for Wax, Resin, and Metallic layers, ensuring high-fidelity transfers in luxury packaging and industrial labeling.</span></p> <div align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center;"> <hr/> </div> <p class="MsoNormal"> <b><span style="color:#009900;">II. Core Technical Advantages</span></b></p> <ul> <li class="MsoNormal"> <b><span style="color:#009900;">Exceptional Thermal Integrity:</span></b><span style="color:#009900;"> Engineered to withstand intense print-head heat with a low shrinkage rate ( at °C). This prevents warping and ensures precise registration for multi-color and holographic transfers.</span>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (34, 358, '出口巴基斯坦和智利的货，需要做产地证的，需在报关之前办理产地证，', '../', '<p><!--StartFragment --></p><div> 即日起，所有出口巴基斯坦和智利的货，需要做产地证的，需在报关之前办理产地证，<br/> 因为报关需要填报原产地证号的，如报关没有填报产地证号，货物到达目的港，不再享受关税优惠！<br/> 1.光有F号码不行，要有联网数据才能报得了关，不然就是报关报不了享惠，对目的港那边有无影响请客户自行确认<br/> 2.产地证上有个港口对应提单上的港口，也对应报关时候的港口，都要对应起来的<br/> 3.产地证数据出来后入海关库里可能有时间问题,要提前几个工作日申请的。<br/> 具体的原产地查询网址：<img src="data:image/png;base64,"/>http://cas.chinaport.gov.cn/cas/login?service=http%3A%2F%2Fweb.chinaport.gov.cn%2FCooq%2Findex.html<br/> </div>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (34, 262, 'BOPET metalized film (Polyester metallized film )', '../upload/image/20180826/20180826204843_53003.jpg', '<p></p><p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">BOPET metalized film (Polyester metallized film )</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Color : Silver metallized</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Thickness : 1.5,3.8,4.5,6.0,8.0,10.0,12,14,15,25,50,75,150,185,250,380,450…Microns</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Width :95-1800MM</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Length :6000-36000M</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Inner core :3”(76MM),6”(76MM).</span></p> <p align="left" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Applications: used for packaging ,lamination ,and so forth.</span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (34, 257, 'BOPET PLAIN FILM', '../upload/image/20180923/20180923113207_18937.jpg', '<p></p><p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:24px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">BOPET PLAIN FILM</span><br/> </b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">BOPET film (biaxially oriented Polyester films) featurines good thermal stability and tenacity; low air and water permeability; applicable to vacuum aluminum plating, compound package, cooking bag manufacture, etc. </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Featuring : </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Having the good adhesion with ink and coating, can be used for multi-color printings with good flatness. Is mainly used in heat-sealing bags of frozen food, industrial products and cosmetics packaging.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Specification:</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">thickness: 12 microns-25 microns, 75 microns-150 microns ,185 microns-380 microns, 500 microns</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">width :200-1200MM </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">length : 500m ,1000m ,1500m,4000m,6000m,9000m,12000m</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Polyester film is wound around paper shaft with an internal diameter of 76.2mm-152.4mm and covered with polyethylene film; each coil is supported by damper and put in carton; medium and large package needs wooden mount.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Customer''s own requirement is available for us such as printed OEM logos and private label or particular size and package style.</span><br/> <br/> </span></p> <p align="center" style="color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:24px;''><b><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Polyester Film Test Report</span></b><b></b></span></p> <div align="center" style="color:#59595B;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="671"> <tbody> <tr> <td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="122"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Film Item</span></p> </td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="105"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">BOPET</span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="90"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Date</span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="123"> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="84"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Quantity</span></p> </td> <td colspan="2" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="148"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2,841tons</span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="3" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="122"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:T